<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais sets Hopewell warrants.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets Hopewell warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Wednesday it has issued 650 million American style call warrants on Hopewell Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$3.8925	PREMIUM	    15.55 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.1103	GEARING	    3.92X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	12.MAR.98	PAYMENT DATE     02.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     04.APR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$4.325	 MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p> ISSUER'S DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
